L0242: Missing prerequisite for a derived trait

A requested derive has prerequisite traits that are not present. Copy requires Clone and Eq requires PartialEq; deriving one does not silently invent the other. Add the compatible prerequisite or remove the unsupported promise.

Example from `tests/corpus/reject/copy_without_clone.lc`; the full file is a regression test.

```rust
// `Copy` requires `Clone`, as in Rust (E0277), and `Eq` requires `PartialEq`.
#[derive(Copy)]
struct Point {
    x: u8,
    y: u8,
}

#[derive(Eq, Debug)]
enum Mode {
    Off,
    On,
}
```

Language, as built: [1.3:2](../../atlas.html#/doc/language/spec-1.3:2).
